## 1. Test Plan Template

```markdown
# Test Plan: [Project Name]

**Document Version:** 1.0  
**Date:** [Date]  
**Author:** QA Lead / Engineer  
**Target Release:** v1.0.0  

---

### 1. Scope of Testing
* **In-Scope:**
  * Authentication & Authorization (JWT, RBAC)
  * Core Business Logic (e.g., Reservation, Checkout, Double-Booking Prevention)
  * Frontend UI/UX across target viewports (Desktop, Mobile)
  * API Integration & Endpoints (REST)
* **Out-of-Scope:**
  * Third-party payment gateway internal mechanics
  * Server load testing beyond 5,000 concurrent users

---

### 2. Testing Strategy & Levels
| Level | Scope / Description | Tools Used |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Unit Testing** | Individual functions, Django models, React components | PyTest, Jest |
| **Integration Testing** | API endpoints, DB transactions, Axios interceptors | DRF APITestCase, Postman |
| **E2E Testing** | User journeys (Registration $\rightarrow$ Checkout) | Playwright / Cypress |
| **UI/UX & Compatibility** | Cross-browser and responsive layout testing | Chrome DevTools, Safari |
| **Security Testing** | RBAC permission bypass, SQLi, XSS, Token Expiry | OWASP ZAP, Postman |

---

### 3. Entry & Exit Criteria
* **Entry Criteria:**
  * Feature branch merged to Staging environment.
  * Unit test coverage $\ge 80\%$.
  * All database migrations executed successfully without errors.
* **Exit Criteria:**
  * 0 Critical / Blocker bugs open.
  * $100\%$ execution of high-priority manual/automated test cases.
  * All core API endpoints returning expected status codes under standard load.

---

### 4. Test Deliverables
* Test Cases Repository
* Execution Logs & Playwright Trace Files
* Bug Reports & Severity Matrix
* Final QA Sign-off Report

```

